&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — able to translate ambiguous business reporting needs into concrete data requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce data and/or customer success platforms (e.g., Totango, Zendesk, Gainsight) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
