&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation with equity and 401k&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare with dental and vision coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off and paid holiday time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks of new parent or family leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal and professional development resources&lt;/li&gt;
